  "description": "MINKIH crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C36 H78 Er6 N12 O36,3(C2 H3 N1). From the CIF bond table, Er1 (Er) has 7 O neighbors; Er2 (Er) has 7 O neighbors; Er3 (Er) has 7 O neighbors; Er1A (Er) has 7 O neighbors; Er2A (Er) has 7 O neighbors; Er3A (Er) has 7 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 6 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.691-3.707 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 108.75-111.48°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C42H84N15O36Er6. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 6 NO3 (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
